Third-party material

internal/dts/tables_gen.go holds tables generated from FFmpeg's libavcodec
(dcadata.c, dcahuff.c, dca_sample_rate_tab.h; https://ffmpeg.org), which are
licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later.
Most of them are the tables of ETSI TS 102 114 (DTS Coherent Acoustics),
Annex D; the ADPCM and high frequency VQ codebooks, which that
specification does not print, come from FFmpeg alone.

internal/aac/tables_gen.go holds the AAC code books and scale factor bands
of ISO/IEC 14496-3, generated from FFmpeg's libavcodec/aactab.c (LGPL 2.1
or later), which carries them.
